WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.268 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.370 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.404 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That's so good to hear.

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.305 size:81% position:41% line:92%
