00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.439 line:92%
Vice President Kamala Harris

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.507 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
met virtually today

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.708 line:92%
with the president of Guatemala.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:12.879 size:88% position:44%
Incidentally, Guatemala
is what Fox News insists

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.147 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
