00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was announced on Friday
that President Biden

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
will visit Atlanta
later this week,

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
despite Georgia's
new voting laws,

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
which, for some reason,
forbid it.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:26.793
The FBI arrested a man last week
who allegedly participated

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the January attack
on the Capitol,

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:32.298
after he bragged to a matc
on the dating app Bumble

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she turned him in
to authorities.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:35.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is she still single?
Yes.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
But did she find something
better than sex?

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:39.305 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Also yes.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:43.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Advocates for D.C. statehood
protested last week

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:46.112
