houseboat.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because, after all,
if a boat can be a house,

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.251 line:92%
then D.C. can be a state.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
According to a new report,

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
