his more serious side.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, come on.
You can be serious

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:05.932 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and go by a nickname.

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:09.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you think this is
the fun version of Bernard

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
